GlassBox-NR v2.0.0-preview -- aligned to nvngx_dlssnr.dll 310.8.0.0.
An independent CPU C++ reimplementation of the inference chain of that one fixed
target library (reverse-engineered independently; no vendor source, headers or SDK
were used). Not applicable to other versions of the library.

