Provenance statements
=====================

Output-tail stage (B70 / S157), decision 40: the B70 / S157 tail logic was derived by
analysing the NVIDIA binary; the code was independently rewritten and verified
byte-exact against GPU measurements. No program counters, instruction forms or register
names from that analysis are published.

Release payload, decision 41: two of the files in the payload are named
`manifest.json` once laid out. They contain internal round names and paths; they are internal
provenance records, kept unchanged because their sha256 values are pinned elsewhere in
the release and rewriting them would change those pins.

If you redistribute a modified version of this project, please note that it is based on
GlassBox-NR.
